    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Conclusion'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='960' maxwidth='1000' minheight='960' minwidth='1000' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98334' id='3' is-scaled='1' param='C:/Users/megan/Downloads/Screentime &amp; Mental Wellness Analysis Megan Murphy  January 2026.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='98400' x='800' y='833'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='45625' id='5' type-v2='text' w='73500' x='4500' y='1563'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='14'>What have we learned here?</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='14'>Screentime has the strongest relationship to mental wellness in this study. While increasing the time one spends socializing, exercising, or getting good rest could significantly improve mental wellness and lower stress levels, the option that has the largest impact on mental wellness is limiting screentime. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='14'>People who work remotely tend to have higher screentime on average, though students and employed people have higher average screentime overall. You may consider looking for a hybrid or in-person job if your goal is lowering your screentime.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='14'>Screentime habits and mental wellness ratings vary greatly in this study. It would be interesting to dig into that a little more as a continuing business question.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='17' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='98334' id='16' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='833'>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='98334' id='3' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='C:/Users/megan/Downloads/Screentime &amp; Mental Wellness Analysis Megan Murphy  January 2026.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='98400' x='800' y='833'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='45625' id='5' type-v2='text' w='73500' x='4500' y='1563'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='14'>What have we learned here?</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='14'>Screentime has the strongest relationship to mental wellness in this study. While increasing the time one spends socializing, exercising, or getting good rest could significantly improve mental wellness and lower stress levels, the option that has the largest impact on mental wellness is limiting screentime. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='14'>People who work remotely tend to have higher screentime on average, though students and employed people have higher average screentime overall. You may consider looking for a hybrid or in-person job if your goal is lowering your screentime.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='14'>Screentime habits and mental wellness ratings vary greatly in this study. It would be interesting to dig into that a little more as a continuing business question.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{C7138171-21DE-4E0A-B58D-DC044763A41C}' />
    </dashboard>
