            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>Some questions we might have from looking at the data:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- What is screentime&apos;s effect on mental wellness? </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Who logs the most screentime? Does it effect people differently? </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- How can we best improve mental wellness? </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
